### Viajesito — llamadas de ejemplo (REST Client de VS Code / HTTP Client de IntelliJ)
@base = http://localhost:8080
# Si definiste APP_API_KEY en el .env, completala acá:
@apiKey =

### Listar rutas (opcional: ?active=true)
GET {{base}}/api/routes
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Crear ruta
POST {{base}}/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "origin": "EZE",
  "destination": "BCN",
  "departureDate": "2027-04-10",
  "returnDate": "2027-04-28",
  "currency": "USD",
  "targetPriceMin": 850,
  "targetPriceMax": 1050,
  "notes": "Semana Santa en Barcelona"
}

### Modificar ruta (reemplazo completo)
PUT {{base}}/api/routes/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "origin": "EZE",
  "destination": "MAD",
  "departureDate": "2027-02-01",
  "returnDate": "2027-02-20",
  "targetPriceMax": 1000
}

### Pausar / reanudar
POST {{base}}/api/routes/1/pause
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/routes/1/resume
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Borrar ruta (borra también su histórico y alertas)
DELETE {{base}}/api/routes/1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Últimos precios de una ruta
GET {{base}}/api/routes/1/prices?limit=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Resumen estadístico
GET {{base}}/api/routes/1/stats
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Historial de alertas (opcional: ?routeId=1&limit=20)
GET {{base}}/api/alerts
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Probar el bot de Telegram
POST {{base}}/api/telegram/test
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Simular una alerta (lo que envía el analizador Python)
POST {{base}}/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "routeId": 1,
  "price": 980,
  "currency": "USD",
  "airline": "Iberia",
  "stops": 0,
  "alertType": "BELOW_AVERAGE",
  "reasons": ["BELOW_AVERAGE", "TARGET_PRICE"],
  "averagePrice": 1250,
  "medianPrice": 1230,
  "minPrice": 1010,
  "savingsPct": 21.6,
  "sampleSize": 40,
  "trend": "DOWN"
}
